# SYNTAX TEST "text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext" "A fence reads as the language its meta names, not as this dialect by default"

# OPERATOR'S RULING 2026-10-06: a `lar:` URI held inside text that names no construct stays HELD
# TEXT, not an address — a bare inline code span, a plain fence and a fence labelled for another
# language (here, toml) all name something other than this dialect, so the carrier/address/bearing
# family must stop at their edge. A fence whose OWN info string names this dialect
# (`memetic-wikitext`) still reads as an address, because the base grammar's own fence dispatch
# already put `text.html.tiddlywiki5` back on the stack there.
#
# Every target below sits at least one column past the line's own start, so a `^` caret — which
# shares its column numbering with the comment token before it — can address it without losing the
# first character to that token.

x `lar://alias:grant@place/lares.api.pono` held inline, unaddressed.
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.string.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.single.tiddlywiki5 markup.raw.inline.tiddlywiki5
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ - meta.uri.lar.memetic-wikitext

```
x lar://alias:grant@place/lares.api.pono check ni:///sha-256;abcdef0123
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext markup.fenced_code.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.codeblock.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.block.tiddlywiki5
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ - meta.uri.lar.memetic-wikitext
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ - meta.uri.ni.memetic-wikitext
```

```toml meta
x = "lar://alias:grant@place/lares.api.pono"
check = "ni:///sha-256;abcdef0123"
#         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext markup.fenced_code.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.codeblock.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.embedded.block.toml source.toml.tw5-syntax
#         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ - meta.uri.ni.memetic-wikitext
```

```memetic-wikitext
x lar://alias:grant@place/lares.api.pono check ni:///sha-256;abcdef0123
#  ^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext markup.fenced_code.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.codeblock.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.embedded.block.memetic text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5 meta.uri.lar.memetic-wikitext keyword.other.scheme.lar.memetic-wikitext support.type.scheme.lar.memetic-wikitext
#                                              ^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext markup.fenced_code.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.codeblock.tiddlywiki5 markup.inline.raw.block.tiddlywiki5 meta.embedded.block.memetic text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5 meta.uri.ni.memetic-wikitext keyword.other.scheme.ni.memetic-wikitext support.type.scheme.ni.memetic-wikitext
```
